      "priority": "next",
      "name": "Bounded single-source-span/fact inspector",
      "implementation": "Add opt-in read-only retrieval CLI to qualified row/source/query replay, then exact source span or explicit facts. Avoid full prompt decode. Proposed complete response caps 8192 UTF-8 bytes and 2048 qualified local tokens, continuation for oversized units.",
      "acceptance": [
